    "description": "<p>Elite Troopers are among the toughest individuals in the galaxy. After being exposed to numerous threats, foes, and combat situations, you've developed the ability to delay effects that would drop lesser creatures.</p><p>Once per encounter as a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, you can choose to delay the effect of a single attack, ability, or effect used against you. The damage or effect does not take hold until the end of your next turn.</p>",
